// moonrpc (<- gRPC). The north star is REAL gRPC: a self-built HTTP/2 (RFC 7540)
// + HPACK (RFC 7541) transport with stream multiplexing — not gRPC-Web. v0 lands
// the wire primitives shared by every gRPC transport: the length-prefixed message
// framing and the status model. Pure logic; the h2 stack (h2c path, since the
// async TLS layer exposes no ALPN) is sequenced after.
import {
  "moonbitlang/core/buffer",
}
